  "description": "Agentic ADR-conformance review for Tamp builds. Compares a repo's code against its Architecture Decision Records and emits conformance verdicts on the canonical BuildEvent stream (conformance.evaluated, ADR 0023) for downstream attestation in tamp-findings. Three capabilities: rule generation (ADR to machine-checkable rules), rule examination (code vs rules), and reverse examination (code decisions with no ADR). The deterministic (predicate) path is self-contained; the semantic (model-backed) path plugs in a host-provided evaluator.",
